        "Welcome to lab 8 (final lab) of EE 467! In this lab, we're going to detect malware activities with Transformer Natural Language Models. We will work with the ADFA-LD dataset, which consists of system call logs for both benign and malicious activities. You will learn to preprocess these logs into text form, pass them into BERT model for feature extraction, visualize the distribution of features and perform classification on top of these features.\n",
        "\n",
