        "## Dimensionality Reduction and Feature Visualization\n",
        "The BERT embeddings live in a 768-dimensional space — too high to visualize directly. We use [t-SNE](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.manifold.TSNE.html) to project both the textual and concise embeddings down to 3 dimensions, preserving local structure so that samples with similar features appear close together in the plot.\n"
